# /build prototype rules

## Fork and choice cards

When offering two paths (e.g. top up vs build on your machine), **do not auto-select either option**. Neither path is the default preference — no highlighted border, no `lead` class, no pre-selected state. Both cards use the same neutral styling until the user chooses.

## Credits dialog onward journey

The credits upgrade dialog is **multi-step**. Choosing the external harness does not navigate to `app.html` — step two of the same dialog shows both install paths: download the EAI Setup app, or `npx install eai`. Do not include the `/eai` instruction here; that belongs in the install app. Show a single alert that the project name comes with them into their harness. Dialog chrome follows shadcn defaults: **× close** top-right, **Back** anchored bottom-left on the install step.

## Labels

**Labels must not be in capitals.** Use sentence case in copy and CSS. Do not use `text-transform: uppercase` on labels, eyebrows, or option headings in this flow.
